    "result_text": "The full test suite is green (BUILD SUCCESS). \n\nI implemented the change:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `displayName` string property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` gains a `displayName` field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 mapped `displayName` on `toOwnerDto` with a MapStruct expression that formats it exactly as `\"LastName, FirstName\"` from the stored `lastName`/`firstName`.\n\nSince the create endpoint (`addOwner`) and `getOwner` both serialize via `ownerMapper.toOwnerDto(owner)`, the created owner's response now returns `displayName` formatted as `LastName, FirstName`. The acceptance test `coreComputesDisplayName` and the full suite pass.",
